    "text": "<p>From given data <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> atom is alkali metal which is sodium.</p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>",
